    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a survival horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you clear a stage, you will be rewarded according to the amount of items in your basket. The rewards can be used to develop the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, each time a stage is cleared, the enemies are also strengthened, and when the player's HP reaches zero, everything is reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the player's HP reaches 0, everything will be reset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Various items\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put various items such as chairs, tables, and wardrobes in a basket and carry them to the target point,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is rewarded for carrying various items such as chairs, tables, chests, etc. to the target point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808670/extras/8c04e1e3659d1178e3cc3440e90553f5.poster.avif?t=1752065144\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808670/extras/8c04e1e3659d1178e3cc3440e90553f5.webm?t=1752065144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808670/extras/8c04e1e3659d1178e3cc3440e90553f5.mp4?t=1752065144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Switching Cameras\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switching to the camera from above allows you to see the status of the basket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808670/extras/a70305086755c6d2a380dc55d802d9cd.poster.avif?t=1752065144\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808670/extras/a70305086755c6d2a380dc55d802d9cd.webm?t=1752065144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808670/extras/a70305086755c6d2a380dc55d802d9cd.mp4?t=1752065144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Realistic stage\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realistic stages provide a sense of tension. Currently, two stages are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808670/extras/dead87744f89dd67006ed858493d9ebd.poster.avif?t=1752065144\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808670/extras/dead87744f89dd67006ed858493d9ebd.webm?t=1752065144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808670/extras/dead87744f89dd67006ed858493d9ebd.mp4?t=1752065144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The appearance of various other enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are elements such as attacks by magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
